<<if GetIsPartyMemberRecruited($anastasia) is true>>
    {$anastasia}: Oh, let me guess. [nomarkup][Mimicking the bouncer's voice.] <i>Ms. Foster is not taking any visitors at the moment.</i>[/nomarkup] #line:0ca32c6
    {$storyteller}: [nomarkup][He swallows, visibly stressed.][/nomarkup]
    Office Bouncer: ...
    Office Bouncer: Ms. Foster is not taking any visitors at the moment.
    {$anastasia}: See? Told ya.
<<endif>>
